WEBVTT

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:16.800
Happy birthday.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.600
So, how does it feel to be old?

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Chemistry.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.000
It is the study of change.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:32.500
It is growth, then decay, then transformation.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:35.800
Surprise!

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:39.000
Walt, we love you, man. We love you.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.900
Everybody, to Walt!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:55.800
Inoperable.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.900
A substantial amount of methamphetamine being taken off the streets.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.400
Hank, how much money is that?

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:03.900
It's about 700 grand.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.400
It's easy money.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.000
Just say the word and I'll take you on a ride-along.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.300
I'm thinking... if you and I could partner up.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:19.700
You know the business.

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.800
You want to cook crystal meth?

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:28.900
Cooking is art.

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.700
Actually, it's just basic chemistry.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:33.300
Some straight like you is just gonna break bad?

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:36.400
Tell me why you're doing this.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:37.700
I am awake.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.100
I just want you to know, no matter how it may look,

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.000
I only had you in my heart.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.500
Run, Mr. White, run!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:52.900
Get a little excitement in your life.
